    (property "Notes" "Ground-tie link (added 2026-07-31): joins the DC-input ground island (PGND_IN: PS500 pin 1 + input filter/MOV grounds) to audio AGND. Populate with 0R for normal single-ground operation; REMOVE to restore PS500's input/output isolation if a hum/ground loop appears at bring-up." (at 86.36 127.0 0)
